<title>USA: NYC Educational Construction Fund $44 mln priced.</title>
<headline>NYC Educational Construction Fund $44 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said it priced $44 million of New York City Educational Construction Fund junior subordinated revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.78 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.</p>
<p>RE: $44,890,000*</p>
